        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Cefazolin (INN), also known as cefazoline or cephazolin, is a first generation cephalosporin antibiotic. It is administered parenterally, and is active against a broad spectrum of bacteria.</owl:annotatedTarget>
