        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Daptomycin is a novel lipopeptide antibiotic used in the treatment of certain infections caused by Gram-positive organisms. Daptomycin interferes with the bacterial cell membrane, reducing membrane potential and inhibiting cell wall synthesis.</owl:annotatedTarget>
