        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">These antibiotics are derived from tetracycline, a polyketide antibiotic that inhibits the 30S subunit of bacterial ribosomes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
