        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Aminonucleoside antibiotics are nucleoside antibiotics that contain an amino group. This amino group is often acylated, e.g. puromycin.</obo:IAO_0000115>
