        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Novobiocin is an aminocoumarin antibiotic produced by Streptomyces spheroides and Streptomyces niveus, and binds DNA gyrase subunit B inhibiting ATP-dependent DNA supercoiling.</owl:annotatedTarget>
