        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Edeine D is a subtype of edeine similar to edeine A with the beta-tyr replaced by beta-phe-beta-ala. Edeines bind to the 30S subunit to block fMet-tRNA interaction at the P site, inhibiting protein synthesis and subsequent structure/function processes critical for life or replication.</obo:IAO_0000115>
