        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Minocycline is second generation semi-synthetic derivative of the tetracycline group of antibiotics. It inhibits bacterial protein synthesis by binding to the 30S subunit of the bacterial ribosome and preventing the aminotransferase-tRNA from associating with the ribosome.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">PubChem:5281093</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
