        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Rifampin is a semi-synthetic rifamycin, and inhibits RNA synthesis by binding to RNA polymerase. Rifampin is the mainstay agent for the treatment of tuberculosis, leprosy and complicated Gram-positive infections.</obo:IAO_0000115>
