        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">TetE is a tetracycline efflux pump found in many Gram-negative bacteria, especially those in water environments. The gene is found on large plasmids.</obo:IAO_0000115>
