        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">ErmE is a methyltransferase found in the erythromycin producer Saccharopolyspora erythraea. Like other Erm enzymes, it catalyzes the methylation of A2058 of the 23S ribosomal RNA. The gene is found within the erythromycin biosynthetic cluster and is responsible for self-resistance.</obo:IAO_0000115>
