        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Polymyxin B is mixture of mostly polymyxins B1 and B2, mainly used for resistant gram-negative infections. They are polypeptides with cationic detergent action on cell membranes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
