        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Point mutations in DNA gyrase subunit B (gyrB) can result in resistance to aminocoumarins. These mutations usually involve arginine residues in organisms.</obo:IAO_0000115>
