        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">EvgSA is a two-component regulatory system that regulates MdtEF and EmrKY expression for multidrug resistance. EvgS is a sensor protein that phosphorylates the regulatory protein EvgA, though EvgA can be phosphorylated by other methods when it is overexpressed.</obo:IAO_0000115>
