        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Enzymes, other proteins or other gene products shown clinically to confer resistance to mupirocin antibiotics. Mutations in ileS is shown to confer low-level mupirocin resistance, while high-level resistance is conferred by the presence of alternative isoleucyl-tRNA synthetases.</obo:IAO_0000115>
