        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">AdeR is a positive regulator of AdeABC efflux system. AdeR inactivation leads to susceptibility to aminoglycoside antibiotics.</owl:annotatedTarget>
