        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Erm proteins are part of the RNA methyltransferase family and methylate A2058 (E. coli nomenclature) of the 23S ribosomal RNA conferring degrees of resistance to Macrolides, Lincosamides and Streptogramin b. This is called the MLSb phenotype.</owl:annotatedTarget>
