        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Pulvomycin is a polyketide antibiotic that binds elongation factor Tu (EF-Tu) to inhibit protein biosynthesis by preventing the formation of the ternary complex (EF-Tu*GTP*aa-tRNA). Phenotypically, it was shown that pulvomycin sensitivity is dominant over resistance.</owl:annotatedTarget>
