        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">FEZ-1 is an Ambler class B MBL; subclass B3 first isolated from Legionella gormanii.  It has activity against a broad range of beta-lactams and is only active with two Zn(II) ions in the active site.</obo:IAO_0000115>
