        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">mefE is a proton motive efflux pump in Streptococcus pneumoniae that confers resistance to macrolides. It is found on the same operon as mefA and the ABC-efflux pump mel.</obo:IAO_0000115>
