        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Mel, a homolog of MsrA, is an ABC transporter associated with macrolide resistance. It is expressed on the same operon as mefA and mefE, both MFS-type efflux proteins that confer macrolide resistance.</owl:annotatedTarget>
