        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Benzylpenicillin, commonly referred to as penicillin G, is effective against both Gram-positive and Gram-negative bacteria. It is unstable in acid.</owl:annotatedTarget>
