        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Cefalexin is a cephalosporin antibiotic that causes filamentation. It is resistant to staphylococcal beta-lactamase, but degraded by enterobacterial beta-lactamases.</owl:annotatedTarget>
