        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Cefotaxime is a semisynthetic cephalosporin taken parenterally. It is resistant to most beta-lactamases and active against Gram-negative rods and cocci due to its aminothiazoyl and methoximino functional groups.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">PMID:2083516</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
