        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Lividomycins are aminoglycosidic antibiotics produced by Streptomyces lividus. They contain 2-amino-2,3-dideoxy-D-glucose.</obo:IAO_0000115>
