        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Lividomycins are aminoglycosidic antibiotics produced by Streptomyces lividus. They contain 2-amino-2,3-dideoxy-D-glucose.</owl:annotatedTarget>
