        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Demeclocycline is a tetracycline analog with 7-chloro and 6-methyl groups. Due to its fast absorption and slow excretion, it maintains higher effective blood levels compared to other tetracyclines.</obo:IAO_0000115>
