        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Pristinamycin IB is a class B streptogramin similar to pristinamycin IA, the former containing a N-methyl-4-(methylamino)phenylalanine instead of a N-methyl-4-(dimethylamino)phenylalanine in its class A streptogramin counterpart (one less methyl group).</obo:IAO_0000115>
