        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">H-NS is a histone-like protein involved in global gene regulation in Gram-negative bacteria. It is a repressor of the membrane fusion protein genes acrE, mdtE, and emrK as well as nearby genes of many RND-type multidrug exporters.</obo:IAO_0000115>
