        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Sulfacetamide is a very soluable sulfonamide antibiotic previously used to treat urinary tract infections. Its relatively low activity and toxicity to those with Stevens-Johnson syndrome have reduced its use and availability.</obo:IAO_0000115>
