        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Isoprepnyl pyrophosphate removes a phosphate group that is added from the peptidoglycan subunit to permit its transfer across the cell membrane. The phosphate group must be removed before its incorporation into peptidoglycan macromolecules.</obo:IAO_0000115>
