        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">D-Alanine synthetase joins two D-alanines before their addition to the pentapeptide chains of peptidoglycan. It is found in both Gram-positive and Gram-negative bacteria.</obo:IAO_0000115>
