        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">DNA gyrase is responsible for DNA supercoiling and consists of two alpha and two beta subunits. Binding the beta-subunit is sufficient to inhibit DNA supercoiling.</obo:IAO_0000115>
