            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">MdsABC, or GesABC, is a RND-type efflux complex found in Salmonella. In addition to its metal-efflux system, GesABC is also capable of exporting beta-lactams, chloramphenicol, and thiamphenicol. GesB is the inner membrane transporter and is similar to MexF; GesA is the membrane-fusion protein, and GesC is the outer membrane factor.</obo:IAO_0000115>
