        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">MdtEF-TolC is a multidrug efflux complex in Gram-negative bacteria, including E. coli. MdtE is the membrane fusion protein, MdtF is the inner membrane transporter, while TolC is the outer membrane channel.</obo:IAO_0000115>
