        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">PhoQ is a sensor protein that is induced by low Mg2+ concentrations. When activated, PhoQ donates a phosphate to activate PhoP.</obo:IAO_0000115>
