        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">OleD is a glycotransferase found in Streptomyces antibioticus, a natural producer  of oleandomycin. OleD can glycosylate a wide range of macrolides. Unlike oleI, oleD is not found in the oleandomycin biosynthetic cluster.</owl:annotatedTarget>
