        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Amythiamicin A is a cyclic thiazolyl peptide antibiotic with a structure similar to GE2270A. Amythiamicin B, C, and D also exist, but are not discussed further here. Amythiamicin A was shown to have the highest activity in cell free protein synthesis assays.</obo:IAO_0000115>
