        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">ErmO is a methyltransferase found in the spiramycin producer Streptomyces ambofaciens. Like other Erm enzymes, it catalyzes the methylation of A2058 of the 23S ribosomal RNA. Specifically, this enzyme transfers only one methyl group. The gene is responsible for self-resistance to spiramycin.</obo:IAO_0000115>
