        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Two semi-synthetic pleuromutilin derivatives, tiamulin and valnemulin, have been developed as antibiotics for veterinary use.</obo:IAO_0000115>
