        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Azamulin is a semi-synthetic pleuromutilin derivative that failed Stage 1 clinical trials due to poor bioavailability.</obo:IAO_0000115>
