        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">One of a small group of kirromycin-like elfamycins which lack the pyridone moiety. Ganefromycin is produced by Streptomyces lydicus spp. tanzanius, and was considered for use as a growth promoting antibiotic in agriculture.</owl:annotatedTarget>
