        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">AAC(6&apos;)-Ian is an amikacin acetyltransferase gene found on a transferable plasmid of the Serratia marcescens strain NUBL-11663. IT catalyze the transfer of an acetyl group from acetyl coenzyme A onto an amine at the 6&apos;-position of various aminoglycosides.</obo:IAO_0000115>
