        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Cardiolipin synthetase catalyzes the formation of cardiolipin from two phosphatidylglycerol molecules. Cardiolipin is important in membrane translocation and permeabilization. Current known mutations on the enzyme confer resistance to daptomycin.</obo:IAO_0000115>
