        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">ParE is a subunit of topoisomerase IV, necessary for cell survival. Point mutations in ParE prevent fluoroquinolones from inhibiting DNA synthesis, thus conferring resistance.</obo:IAO_0000115>
