        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Sitafloxacin is a fluoroquinolone active against multi-resistant Gram-positive and negative pathogens. Sitafloxacin shows inhibitory activity against DNA gyrase and topoisomerase IV, which blocks bacterial DNA replication, thereby causing double-stranded breaks in the bacterial chromosome.</obo:IAO_0000115>
