        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">nfsB encodes the minor oxygen-insesitive nitroreductase in E. coli. The first step of resistance to nitrofurazone is mutation of nfsA, while the increased resistance associated with second step mutants is a consequence of nfsB mutation.</owl:annotatedTarget>
