        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">lnuE encodes a lincosamide resistance gene isolated from Streptococcus suis that was truncated by an ISEnfa5-cfr-ISEnfa5 segment insertion. It shares the closest sequence similarity to lnuA.</obo:IAO_0000115>
