        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">mgrB is a small transmembrane protein produced in the PhoPQ signalling system. It acts as a negative regulator in this system. Inactivation or down-regulation of mgrB confers colistin resistance by absence as shown in Klebsiella pneumoniae</owl:annotatedTarget>
