        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CyaA (adenylate cyclase) is involved with the synthesis of cyclic AMP which regulates the fosfomycin transporter glpT. As a result, mutations to cyaA confer resistance to fosfomycin.</obo:IAO_0000115>
