        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An antibiotic mixture containing the penicillin-derived beta-lactam antibiotic Ampicillin and the beta-lactamase inhibitor Sulbactam. Also known as Unasyn and/or Ampictam.</obo:IAO_0000115>
