        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Member of the small MDR (multidrug resistance) family of transporters; in Escherichia coli this protein provides resistance against a number of positively charged compounds including ethidium bromide and erythromycin; proton-dependent secondary transporter which exchanges protons for compound translocation</owl:annotatedTarget>
