        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">kdpD is a component of the two-component regulatory system, kdpDE. This system is involved in potassium transport and homeostasis, and has been implicated in virulence factor regulation along with kdpE.</obo:IAO_0000115>
