        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">MexAB-OprM efflux pump system with NalC mutations conferring resistance to aztreonam. While efflux gene hyperexpression typically results from mutations in the linked mexR repressor gene, it also occurs independently of mexR mutations in so-called nalC mutants that demonstrate more modest mexAB-oprM expression and, thus, more modest multidrug resistance than do mexR strains.</obo:IAO_0000115>
