        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">fosA7 is an enzyme that confers resistance to fosfomycin in Escherichia coli by breaking the epoxide ring of the molecule.</owl:annotatedTarget>
