        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Nitroimidazoles are a group of drugs that have both antiprotozoal and antibacterial activity, classified with respect to the location of the nitro functional group.</obo:IAO_0000115>
