        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The outer membrane protein M35 of Moraxella catarrhalis is an antigenically conserved porin. Down-regulation of M35 significantly increases the MICs of aminopenicillins, specifically amoxicillin.</obo:IAO_0000115>
