        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The GOB family of beta-lactamases have been discovered in the Elizabethkingia meningoseptica and are classified as subclass B3 beta-lactamase. They confer resistance to cephalosporins, penicillins, and carbapenems.</owl:annotatedTarget>
