        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The MltA-interacting Protein (MipA) family consists mainly of homologs to MipA and OmpV proteins. Proteins of this family, are predicted to form a ß-barrel.</obo:IAO_0000115>
