        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Lipid A acyltransferase genes confer resistance to certain types of peptide antibiotics such as polymyxins through the aminoacylation of lipopolysaccharide, thereby decreasing the negative charge of the outer membrane surface.</obo:IAO_0000115>
