        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">EUCAST is a standing committee jointly organized by ESCMID, ECDC and European national breakpoint committees; it deals with breakpoints and technical aspects of phenotypic in-vitro antimicrobial susceptibility testing.</obo:IAO_0000115>
