        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Allows for time-dependent or concentration-dependent analysis of antimicrobial effects. Several tubes of broth culture medium containing a suspension of the test microbe are treated with varying concentrations of the antimicrobial agent and the percentage of dead cells determined at various time points.</owl:annotatedTarget>
